 "category": "Pads and atmospheres",
 "text": "Sound: a bright, airy, heavenly pad: each note with its octave and fifth above, ringing in a long echo and a huge reverb.\n\nHow it's built: three sines on each key: the note, its fifth an octave up, and two octaves up: soft but full of shimmer. A slow attack, a long Delay and a big Reverb. Six voices.\n\nPlay: high chords, slow.\n\nTweak: the levels on the mixer (the top sines are the shimmer), the delay's FEEDBACK, the reverb's SIZE.",
